Modifications:

Datajack (Tier 4): Datajacks are direct neural interface implants that allow you to directly access computers and information with your mind. They typically resemble a coin-sized dataport that is implanted either on the side of the head (typically in the temporal region of the skull, behind the ear or on the temple) or the back of the neck (just below the brainstem). It comes with a retractable spool of micro-cable (about a meter long) that lets you directly interface with any electronic device via a universal access cable. Datajacks are equipped with their own cache of storage memory for downloading or saving files. Optionally, Datajacks can be installed to be hidden and use an induction link hidden under the skin, but the response rate of the interface drops by around 15-20%.

Control Rig (Tier 4): This implant harnesses the raw data-coordinating and synchronization power of the middle brain for the express purpose of directly manipulating vehicles and drones (and other devices like turrets). When you are linked to a vehicle or drone, the control rig provides a bonus to your piloting skill and the performance of the vehicle.

Muscle Replacement (Tier 4): Vat-grown synthetic muscles augment your own, and calcium treatments and skeletal reinforcement contribute to your overall strength. It increases both your Strength and Dexterity attributes by its tier rating. It cannot be combined with other augmentations to the muscles, including muscle augmentation or muscle toner bioware.

Wired Reflexes (Tier 4): This highly invasive and painful enhancement adds a multitude of neural boosters and adrenaline stimulators in strategic locations throughout your body. The combined effect can make you almost superhumanly fast and agile. +4 Dexterity, +8 bonus to Initiative

Encephalon (Tier 4): This expert-system microprocessor is hardwired directly into the user's cortex, augmenting its user's information-processing abilities allowing and for faster and better handling of complex data. Add the Encephalon tier rating to all Tech skills.

Attention Coprocessor (Tier 4): A cybernetic implant in the frontal cortex and limbic system improves continuous partial attention, helping to keep track of events in the background without losing the foreground. Also improves the sensory cortex to help you glean as much as possible from incoming sensory data. Add the attention coprocessors tier rating as a bonus to your perception skill.

Math SPU (Tier 4): The math SPU allows you to quickly perform any and all mathematical functions, while most of the benefits of the math spu are purely for convenience, you also gain a bonus equal to its tier rating to your Tech: Electronics (Electronic Warfare) skill.

Image Link (Tier 4):This enhancement lets you display visual information (text, pictures, movies, the current time, etc.) in your field of vision.

Smartlink (Tier 4): This modification allows information and targeting enhancements from a smartlink equipped weapon to show in the users vision, much like a built-in HUD.

Vison Enhancement (Tier 4): This sharpens a character’s vision at all ranges, providing visual acuity closer to that of the average hawk. Each tier rating of this modification increases adds a bonus to any Perception Test involving vision.

Flare Compensation (Tier 4): An implanted version of the flare compensation enhancement. This protects you from blinding flashes of light as well as simple glare. It mitigates the vision modifiers for glare and reduces the penalty from flashing lights, like from a flash-pak.

Biomonitor (Tier 4): A favorite of soldiers and corporate types, this is an under-skin display mounted on the forearm. It provides a real-time readout of common body functions like heart rate, blood pressure, blood chemistry, brainwave activity, temperature, cholesterol levels and a number of other bodily functions.

Adrenaline Pump (Tier 4): This enhanced gland is implanted in the lower abdomen, connected to both supradrenal glands. When dormant, the pump is merely a reservoir for adrenaline. When activated, a small muscular sac contracts, sending a surge of concentrated adrenaline into the blood stream. While active you can add the Adrenaline Pumps tier rating as a bonus to your Strength, Dexterity, and Constitution. After the effects have worn off, you suffer from extreme lethargy and possible unconsciousness.

Bone Density Augmentation (Tier 3): The molecular structure of your bones is altered to increase density and tensile strength. Ligaments are strengthened, and the increased bone density increases your weight a bit. Bone density augmentation is incompatible with other augmentations to the bones, including bone lacing cyberware.

Cerebral Booster (Tier 3): The convolutions and gyri of your cerebrum are augmented and amplified with additional nervous tissue, improving overall brain function. The cerebral booster adds its tier rating to your Intelligence.

Sleep Regulator (Tier 3): The sleep regulator is a modification to the hypothalamus, allowing for longer periods of wakefulness, an incredibly useful advantage for anyone with any profession. You need less sleep per day and the sleep you get is deep and restful (and harder to wake you up from). The sleep regulator lets you get by with three hours of sleep each night and stay awake for twice as long as normal before having to resist sleep deprivation fatigue.

